The <ansi fg="command">caravan</ansi> command provides admin control over the caravan
state machine.

<ansi fg="command">caravan reset</ansi>
Reset every active caravan leader in the world back to the starting
ThornwallDwell state. Use this to recover from stuck states caused by
server restarts mid-cycle or permanent hostile detection.

<ansi fg="command">caravan reset [instanceId]</ansi>
Reset a single caravan leader by mob instance ID. Useful when only one
leader is stuck and a world-wide reset would be disruptive.

